description:
This is a combined synopsis/solicitation for commercial items prepared in accordance with the format in FAR Part 12. This announcement constitutes the only solicitation. Quotations are being requested and a separate written solicitation will not be issued.&nbsp; 

Solicitation number 1284LL27Q0007 is issued as a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for Ammonia System Maintenance. The vendor shall provide the personnel, supplies and equipment needed to perform the maintenance to industry standards and specifications. 

See attachment 1284LL27Q0007 for more details. 

This acquisition is set-aside for small business concerns. The applicable North American Industry Classification Standard Code is 811310&nbsp; The small business size standard is $12.5 million dollars. This acquisition is a Total Small Business Set-Aside. All responsible sources may submit a quotation which will be considered by the agency.&nbsp;
